From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:13:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: markup pointers and the editing of IMarkupServices

IMarkupPointer/IMarkupPointer2 were all E_NOTIMPL; they are positions between
the tokens of a document (begin tag, end tag, each character of text) kept as
collapsed DOM ranges, so they follow the document as it changes. Implemented:
MoveAdjacentToElement, MoveToPointer, MoveToContainer, Left and Right over
text, begin and end tags and no-scope elements, CurrentScope, the five
comparisons, GetContainer, OwningDoc, gravity and cling, Unposition,
IsPositioned, MoveUnit for characters and words, FindText, IsAtWordBreak,
GetMarkupPosition/MoveToMarkupPosition, MoveUnitBounded, MoveToContent.
IMarkupServices: CreateElement (tag ids and attribute text), CloneElement,
InsertElement, RemoveElement, Remove, Copy, Move, InsertText, ParseGlobal,
ParseString with pointers, IsScopedElement, the tag id and name lookups,
MovePointersToRange, MoveRangeToPointers, undo units, and
IMarkupContainer::OwningDoc.

